              "text": "तीर्थयात्रा — tīrthayātrā — \"a pilgrimage\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "अहं श्वः तीर्थयात्रां गमिष्यामि। ahaṃ śvaḥ tīrthayātrāṃ gamiṣyāmi. Tomorrow I will go on a pilgrimage."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A feminine noun."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "तीर्थयात्रा (tīrthayātrā) is built from tīrtha, \"a ford, a holy bathing place\", and yātrā, \"a journey\"; MW gives the compound as a journey to holy places, a pilgrimage (MW)."
            }
          ]
        },
